WEBVTT

00:02:59.217 --> 00:03:03.095
13 million more than in 2007,
before the global financial crisis.

00:03:03.471 --> 00:03:05.056
Clearly, something is broken.

00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:07.350
You can disagree with me
about everything else,

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:09.310
but those are the facts.

00:03:09.352 --> 00:03:11.771
In the UK, a much smaller country,

00:03:12.647 --> 00:03:18.569
in 2016, 17 million people of working age

00:03:18.611 --> 00:03:20.696
had 100 pounds or less savings.

00:03:21.697 --> 00:03:24.659
They are one minor accident
away from penury.

00:03:24.659 --> 00:03:28.537
17 million people of working age.

00:03:29.956 --> 00:03:32.667
And on the thing that capitalism
asks to be judged by,